<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Hong Leong Credit year net up 33pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hong Leong Credit year net up 33pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 283.29   vs	 213.82</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 82.4    vs	  62.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,009.45   vs     1,488.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   686.08   vs	 110.82</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less  113.72   vs  less  83.82</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  add     0.11   vs  less   0.95</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    18.0    vs	  15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Hong Leong Credit Bhd is engaged in commercial banking, financial services and property.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
